'''Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger''' (操られしゴールドにゃんこ, ''Ayatsura Reshi Gōrudo Nyanko'', '''Possessed Gold Cat''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy. She was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger
|image = E 776.png
|first appearance = [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 20|魅惑の堕天楼 - Floor 20]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
This unwilling villain is quite the handful, possessing an oppressive kit that severely hinders your ability to stall her. Her [[Wave Attack]]s are guaranteed to kill most low-level meatshields, while [[Knockback|knocking back]] any non-immune survivors. With the aid of her supports, it is virtually impossible to single her out with any slow attackers. She is also quite fast.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 20|Fascinating Fallen Tower Floor 20]] for strategies.

